name=ZombieSync MP [B42]
id=ZombieSyncMP
author=druid
description=Smooth multiplayer zombies. Zombies another player is fighting are drawn along the path they really walked, a fixed ~0.1 s behind, instead of chasing an old guessed point and teleporting when they fall 3 tiles behind; they turn smoothly instead of snapping on every update, and they no longer sit "eating" a player who is standing. Zombies you simulate are sent 4x more often (within an upload budget). Client-side Java (ZombieBuddy); every player needs it. If anything goes wrong it switches itself off and vanilla sync is used.
require=\ZombieBuddy
category=mechanic
versionMin=42.21
modversion=1.0.0
javaJarFile=media/java/ZombieSyncMP.jar
javaPkgName=com.druid.zombiesync
ZBVersionMin=2.3.4
